  {
   "type": "page_break"
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "Create Report",
   "num": "2."
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "2.1 Check session",
   "level": 1,
   "bold": true
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "a.",
   "text": "If the session is expired - cancel export. Log item No.1 in Logging Message Table.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "2.2 Connect to database",
   "level": 1,
   "bold": true
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "a.",
   "text": "CONNECTED - go to 2.3. CANNOT CONNECT - Log item No.2 in Logging Message Table; cancel export.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "2.3 Retrieve data (same rule as the Order List grid)",
   "level": 1,
   "bold": true
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "a.",
   "text": "Data visibility by login user: IELP Admin / Planner VPLD - all orders; Supplier (Viewer / LP Admin) - orders of own trucking company; Driver - orders of own truck.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "b.",
   "text": "Filter: Order Date >= Date From (if filled) and <= Date To (if filled); DTP Loc. From = From Loc. (if selected); DTP Loc. To = To Loc. (if selected); Type = DTP tab (if not ALL).",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "c.",
   "text": "Search keyword (if filled, case-insensitive, contains) on: No. Order, Trucking Comp., License Plate, Driver, DTP Loc. From/To, Renban, Shift, Type, Date, Order Status, PO Number, Container No. and status of every cycle.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "d.",
   "text": "Sort by the current sort column / direction of the grid (default No. Order ascending).",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "e.",
   "text": "All matching records are exported, not only the current page of the grid.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "f.",
   "text": "If no record - show message, no file. Log item No.3 in Logging Message Table.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "g.",
   "text": "If record count > maximum rows (TBD) - show message, no file. Log item No.4 in Logging Message Table.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "column_break"
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "Generate Excel Report File",
   "num": "3."
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "3.1",
   "text": "Create file \"Daily Order Monitoring_YYYYMMDDHHMISS.xlsx\" (system date-time of the click) with one sheet \"Daily Order Monitoring\" using the template in Figure 1 / Figure 2 of Report Layout.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "3.2",
   "text": "Header (rows 1-9): report title, Printed by (user name + role), Printed date, and the criteria used; empty criteria printed as \"All\" (Search as \"-\").",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "3.3",
   "text": "Column header (rows 11-12): single columns merged over 2 rows; CYCLE 1..5 merged over 3 columns with sub-header Time, Status, Container No.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "3.4",
   "text": "Body (row 13 onwards): one row per order, No = running number 1..n in the sort order of 2.3.d.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "3.5",
   "text": "Cycle n columns: if the order has no cycle n, print \"-\" in Time, Status and Container No. Time = latest activity time of the cycle (Finish Cycle, else Pick Up, else Start Cycle).",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "3.6",
   "text": "Footer: one empty row, then \"Total : n record(s)\".",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "3.7",
   "text": "If generation fails - Log item No.5 in Logging Message Table; no file.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "Download",
   "num": "4."
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "4.1",
   "text": "Send the file to the browser download; show message with the number of rows. Log item No.6 in Logging Message Table.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "4.2",
   "text": "The file is not stored on the server (Report File Keeping Period: not applicable).",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "REMARK >> Export does not change any data. Cell styling (bold header, borders, freeze pane): TBD.",
   "level": 1,
   "bold": true
  },
  {
